/! Project Summary
section.project-at-a-glance
	.container
		.row
			.col-lg-12
				.squiggle
				h6.text-center.mb-3 Project at a glance
				h2.text-center Designing for access and opportunity.
				p.lead.text-center.mb-5
		  			| A Baltimore-based youth career initiative needed a standalone website to communicate its mission, organize its programs and resources, and better serve students, educators, employers, and community partners. I partnered with Drio Duo to design and develop a responsive WordPress experience that extended the client’s brand into a clear and accessible digital platform.
		.row.highlights
			.col-md-3.mb-5
				i.fad.fa-browser
				h5 Dedicated digital presence
				p Expanded the initiative from a single landing page into a standalone website.
			.col-md-3.mb-5
				i.fad.fa-code
				h5 Design + development
				p Created the high-fidelity mockups and developed the responsive WordPress website.
			.col-md-3.mb-5
				i.fad.fa-users
