/! Challenge
section#challenge.challenge
  .container
	.row.align-items-center.g-5
	  .col-lg-5
		h2 The challenge
		p.lead.text-mb-5
		  | The client had previously been limited to a single landing page within another organization's website and needed a dedicated digital presence to support its growing youth career initiative.

		p.lead
		  | The new website needed to communicate the organization's mission, introduce its five core program areas, and guide multiple audiences toward relevant training, resources, and opportunities. The challenge was organizing a significant amount of information without overwhelming users while staying aligned with the client's established branding.

	  .col-lg-7
		= link_to image_path("portfolio/youth-career-website/youth-career-resources-before-after.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Before and after: The website evolved from a single landing page into a dedicated digital experience with clearer content organization, stronger visual storytelling, and more accessible pathways to programs and resources." do
		  = image_tag "portfolio/youth-career-website/youth-career-resources-before-after.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto border border-2 border-dark rounded-3 box-shadow", :alt=>"Before-and-after comparison showing the original landing page and redesigned youth career initiative homepagen"
		p.small.text-center.mt-3.mb-0
		  | Before and after: The website evolved from a single landing page into a dedicated digital experience with clearer content organization, stronger visual storytelling, and more accessible pathways to programs and resources.

/! Approach
section#approach
  .container
	.row.g-5
		.col-lg-5.position-sticky.mx-auto.top-0.vh-100
			h2 My approach
			p.lead.mb-4
				| I partnered with Drio Duo to translate the client’s goals, content, and existing identity into a clear digital experience designed around its programs and audiences.
			.approach-steps
				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-sitemap
						h5 Structure the experience
					p Organized the content around the client’s programs and audiences, creating clear pathways to help visitors understand the initiative and find relevant resources.

				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-swatchbook
						h5 Extend the visual identity
					p Worked with the existing logo to establish typography and create bespoke visual elements for the website. I applied the new visual direction throughout the high-fidelity mockups to create a cohesive and engaging experience.
				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-laptop-code
						h5 Design + develop
					p Translated the approved mockups into a responsive WordPress website, maintaining consistency between the designs and final build while prioritizing usability and accessibility.

				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-comments
						h5 Collaborate + refine
					p Worked with Drio Duo throughout the project to incorporate feedback, refine the experience, and ensure the final website aligned with the client’s content, brand, and communication goals.


		.col-lg-7
			.card.bg-gradient-soft.p-4.mb-5
				h6.mb-2 Design exploration
				h3 Establishing the visual direction
				p.mb-4 I explored multiple homepage directions to establish the visual system, refine the content hierarchy, and create a cohesive experience before moving into development.
				= link_to image_path("portfolio/youth-career-website/youth-career-home-concepts.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Selected homepage iterations showing how the visual direction, content hierarchy, and layout evolved throughout the design process." do
						= image_tag "portfolio/youth-career-website/youth-career-home-concepts.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto border border-2 border-dark rounded-3 box-shadow", :alt=>"Three homepage design concepts showing different visual and layout directions for the youth career initiative website."
						
			.card.bg-gradient-soft.p-4.mb-5
				h6.mb-2 Collaboration + Interation
				h3 Refining the experience together
				p.mb-4 I collaborated closely with Drio Duo throughout the design process, using Figma to review concepts, refine the experience, and resolve design and content decisions before translating the approved direction into WordPress.

				.row.g-4
					.col-md-6
						= link_to image_path("portfolio/youth-career-website/youth-career-website-design-collaboration.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Figma feedback and design discussions showing the collaborative process used to evaluate options, resolve UX and content questions, and refine the final experience." do
							= image_tag "portfolio/youth-career-website/youth-career-website-design-collaboration.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto border border-2 border-dark rounded-3 box-shadow", :alt=>"Figma feedback and design discussions showing the collaborative process used to evaluate options, resolve UX and content questions, and refine the final experience."

						h5.mt-3.mb-2 Design feedback + iteration
						p.small.mb-0
							| Collaborated with Drio Duo in Figma to explore layout options, share recommendations, and refine designs through ongoing feedback.

					.col-md-6
						= link_to image_path("portfolio/youth-career-website/youth-career-website-design-collaboration-2.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Figma design screens and comments showing collaborative UX, content, and visual design decisionsn" do
							= image_tag "portfolio/youth-career-website/youth-career-website-design-collaboration-2.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto border border-2 border-dark rounded-3 box-shadow", :alt=>"Figma design screens and comments showing collaborative UX, content, and visual design decisionsn"

						h5.mt-3.mb-2 UX + content decisions
